    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mimicry \u2013 Multiplayer horror where anyone could be the monster. Can you help or kill your friends?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a chilling game of deception and survival in <i>Mimicry</i>, an online co-op horror experience for up to 9 players. One of you is infected by a mysterious alien parasite and can transform into any other player\u2014or a terrifying monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad As the impostor monster, your goal is to eliminate the squad while blending in with the group. Use disguise, stealth, and deadly power to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 As a survivor, you must work with others, solve tasks, and escape\u2026 without trusting anyone too much. One wrong move and your friend might become your killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 Play as a shapeshifting <strong>alien monster</strong> or a <strong>human survivor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Multiplayer gameplay </strong>with up to 9 players per match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deception-based mechanics</strong>: hide in plain sight, betray, survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Real-time voice chat </strong>for immersive and chaotic communication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Various maps </strong>with dark, atmospheric settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Full character customization</strong>: hair, face, clothes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Unpredictable matches</strong>: every round is different<br><br>Will you be able to detect the monster and warn your team members?\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Mimicry \u2013 Multiplayer horror where anyone could be the monster. Can you help or kill your friends?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a chilling game of deception and survival in <i>Mimicry</i>, an online co-op horror experience for up to 9 players. One of you is infected by a mysterious alien parasite and can transform into any other player\u2014or a terrifying monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad As the impostor monster, your goal is to eliminate the squad while blending in with the group. Use disguise, stealth, and deadly power to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 As a survivor, you must work with others, solve tasks, and escape\u2026 without trusting anyone too much. One wrong move and your friend might become your killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc79 Play as a shapeshifting <strong>alien monster</strong> or a <strong>human survivor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Multiplayer gameplay </strong>with up to 9 players per match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deception-based mechanics</strong>: hide in plain sight, betray, survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Real-time voice chat </strong>for immersive and chaotic communication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Various maps </strong>with dark, atmospheric settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Full character customization</strong>: hair, face, clothes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Unpredictable matches</strong>: every round is different<br><br>Will you be able to detect the monster and warn your team members?\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p></li></ul>",
